<title>USA: DePaul University, Ill., repriced, yields lowered.</title>
<headline>DePaul University, Ill., repriced, yields lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Chicago Capital Markets Inc said Wednesday it repriced Illinois Educational Facilities Authority's $58.7 million bond deal for DePaul University, lowering yields in several maturities and cutting the top yield in 2019 to 5.83 percent from 5.85 percent.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
